{"book":"2chronicles","num":24,"verses":[{"en":"Joash was seven years old when he began to reign, and he reigned forty years in Jerusalem. His mother's name also was Zibiah of Beer-sheba.","n":1,"sm":"Ioasa e E fitu tausaga o loasa ina o fai o ia ta tupu; ua fai foi o ia ta tupu i lerusalema i tausaga e fa sefulu. O le igoa o lona tiná foi o Sevi o le Peresepa.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ioasa"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"E"},{"en":"","sm":"fitu"},{"en":"","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"loasa"},{"en":"","sm":"ina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ta"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu;"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"ta"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lerusalema"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"tausaga"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"fa"},{"en":"","sm":"sefulu."},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"igoa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lona"},{"en":"","sm":"tiná"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"Sevi"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Peresepa."}]},{"en":"And Joash did that which was right in the sight of the LORD all the days of Jehoiada the priest.","n":2,"sm":"Ua faia foi e Ioasa le amiotonu i luma o le ALII i aso uma o leoiata le faitaulaga.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioasa"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"amiotonu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"luma"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"aso"},{"en":"","sm":"uma"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"leoiata"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faitaulaga."}]},{"en":"And Jehoiada took for him two wives; and he begat sons and daughters.","n":3,"sm":"Ua aumaia e leoiata o aya e toalua má ia. Na fanaua foi ona atalii ma ona afafi