out at the gate of the house of the LORD.","n":8,"sm":"Ua fai atu foi le tupu, ona latou faia lea o le atolaau, ma tuu ai i fafo i le faitotoa o le fale o le ALII.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tupu,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"faia"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"atolaau,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"tuu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"fafo"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"faitotoa"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"fale"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII."}]},{"en":"And they made a proclamation through Judah and Jerusalem, to bring in to the LORD the collection that Moses the servant of God laid upon Israel in the wilderness.","n":9,"sm":"Ona latou tala‘i atu ai lea i Iuta ma Ierusalema e au mai i le ALII le taulaga na poloai mai ai Mose le auauna a le Atua ia Isaraelu i le vao.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"tala‘i"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Iuta"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"Ierusalema"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"ALII"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"taulaga"},{"en":"","sm":"na"},{"en":"","sm":"poloai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"Mose"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"auauna"},{"en":"","sm":"a"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"Atua"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Isaraelu"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"vao."}]},{"en":"And all the princes and all the people rejoiced, and brought in, and cast into the chest, until they had made an end.","n":10,"sm":"Ona fiafia lea o alii uma ma le nuu uma, ua latou au mai a latou taulaga, ma lafo i